## PROJECT STRUCTURE

```
twelve-step-companion/
├── app/                      # expo-router screens
│   ├── (auth)/              # Auth gate (lock screen)
│   ├── (tabs)/              # Main tab navigation
│   ├── journal/             # Journal screens
│   ├── onboarding/          # First-time setup
│   ├── settings/            # App settings
│   ├── step-work/           # 12-step work modules
│   └── vault/               # Motivation vault
├── components/
│   ├── common/              # Shared (ErrorBoundary, CrisisButton)
│   ├── journal/             # Journal components
│   ├── progress/            # SobrietyCounter, charts
│   └── ui/                  # Design system (Button, Card, Input)
├── lib/
│   ├── constants/           # App constants, prompts
│   ├── db/                  # SQLite client, models
│   ├── encryption/          # Crypto utilities
│   ├── hooks/               # Custom React hooks
│   ├── store/               # Zustand stores
│   └── utils/               # Utility functions
└── md/                      # Documentation
```

