## REMEMBER

> This app serves people in recovery from addiction. Every design decision
> should ask: "Does this support someone having their worst day?"
> 
> Privacy isn't a feature—it's a promise. Users trust us with their most
> vulnerable moments. Never betray that trust.
>
> Progress, not perfection. The app should embody this principle in every
> interaction.

